        text: "Choose 1 of your opponent's Pok\xE9mon. This attack does 30 damage to that Pok\xE9mon. This attack's damage isn't affected by Weakness, Resistance, Pok\xE9-Powers, Pok\xE9-Bodies, or any other effects on that Pok\xE9mon."
