          text: "Once during your turn (before your attack), if 1 of your Pok\xE9mon-GX or Pok\xE9mon-EX was Knocked Out during your opponent's last turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 cards and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck. You can't use more than 1 Cat Walk Ability each turn."
