        text: "Call Energy provides [C] Energy. Once during your turn, if the Pok\xE9mon Call Energy is attached to is your Active Pok\xE9mon, you may search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pok\xE9mon and put them onto your Bench. If you do, shuffle your deck and your turn ends.",
